{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/f4ca045a66f7f153d259cd061159e767.avif?t=1772805403\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bad Beat</strong> invites you to play a game where your soul is the ultimate ante.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into a strange, dark casino, but once inside, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the dealers at their own game, and you can leave. Lose, and you\u2019ll become part of the casino forever, just another lost soul for eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters.\u00a0Can you outplay fate itself?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/61177e25e781fc5fe467ca77222a39a0.avif?t=1772805403\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grid is your defense and your weapon. <br>Control the grid on the board and plan every move. Position it wisely to deal damage and chain combos, manipulating the flow of the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/8d4833d2ead51c508335a1626bbd68c5.poster.avif?t=1772805403\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/8d4833d2ead51c508335a1626bbd68c5.webm?t=1772805403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/8d4833d2ead51c508335a1626bbd68c5.mp4?t=1772805403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/2812302659162f4e56f687704cab68de.avif?t=1772805403\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal damage to the dealer\u2019s chips by forming poker, pairs, three-of-a-kind, straights, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine tiles to unleash powerful attacks and discover deadly synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/38ac93132c48554bb209246abb9802df.poster.avif?t=1772805403\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/38ac93132c48554bb209246abb9802df.webm?t=1772805403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/38ac93132c48554bb209246abb9802df.mp4?t=1772805403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/dc176ea18b5e7b21825be0f2845cce9a.avif?t=1772805403\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain Lucky Charms that grant you abilities, and cards with game-altering effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Experiment with different builds, adapting to the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck might save you once, but skill, strategy, and a bit of insanity are your only real allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/979636d433d7b782ba7581bba74327eb.poster.avif?t=1772805403\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/979636d433d7b782ba7581bba74327eb.webm?t=1772805403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/979636d433d7b782ba7581bba74327eb.mp4?t=1772805403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bad Beat is inspired by amazing games like</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inscryption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balatro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legend of Bum-bo</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4116250?t=1772805403","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4116250?t=1772805403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/14b907656eb64a19a012726ecd3d13244037a0ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772805403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/14b907656eb64a19a012726ecd3d13244037a0ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772805403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116250/extras/f4ca045a66f7f153d259cd061159e767.avif?t=1772805403\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bad Beat</strong> invites you to play a game where your soul is the ultimate ante.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into a strange, dark casino, but once inside, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the dealers at th